{"unit_id": "1321928757__dsh-mysql#feature-1", "repo": "1321928757/dsh-mysql", "commit": "b200ed57b3c6c1fc0359bd97a972c255f6bad052", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-mysql 的功能「会话级数据源选择」：在输入栏打开数据源面板，为当前会话选择或取消选择已配置的 MySQL 连接；多连接时可指定单个目标，选择集合会进入会话上下文。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:1748-1755", "lib/index.js:180-260"]}
{"unit_id": "1321928757__dsh-mysql#feature-2", "repo": "1321928757/dsh-mysql", "commit": "b200ed57b3c6c1fc0359bd97a972c255f6bad052", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-mysql 的功能「查询与表结构查看」：Agent 可调用 mysql_query 执行单条只读 SQL，并用 mysql_tables 浏览默认数据库中符合白名单的表结构；查询结果最多返回 2000 行。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:304-376"]}
{"unit_id": "1321928757__dsh-mysql#feature-3", "repo": "1321928757/dsh-mysql", "commit": "b200ed57b3c6c1fc0359bd97a972c255f6bad052", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-mysql 的功能「受控写入与结构变更」：连接设置分别开启写入或 DDL 权限后，Agent 可调用 mysql_execute 执行 INSERT、UPDATE、DELETE，或调用 mysql_ddl 修改表、视图和索引结构。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:377-470", "lib/client.js:1660-1726"]}
